# shell: desktop
# home: fixture
# prefs: factory
# setup: report
# board: dead
# dead-after: 8
# open: /devices/nrf54lm20b
# A folder open on a board that stops answering costs the loop nothing.
#
# The other half of a quiet board: a window showing one of its folders.
# When the board cannot say what changed, every open folder re-lists
# to find out, and a folder on the board asked its listing on the loop
# with a six-second ceiling, every notice pump.  Here the window is
# opened on the board's root before it goes quiet; afterwards the loop
# is asked how long its turns got.
wait 60
expect-read trail:mount /devices/nrf54lm20b
expect-title nrf54lm20b
expect-under turns 100
note the board goes quiet now; the folder is still open on it
wait 1400
expect-under turns 100
note and the desk is still answering, the window still there
expect-title nrf54lm20b
quit
